### Review System Endpoints Testing (Purchase-Verified)

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@contentType = application/json
@token = <paste-customer-token-here>

###
### ATTEMPT REVIEW BEFORE DELIVERY (Should fail with 403)
POST {{baseUrl}}/products/1/reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "rating": 5,
  "comment": "Great product!"
}

###
### GET REVIEWS FOR PRODUCT (Public endpoint, no auth required)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/1/reviews

###
### GET REVIEWS FOR PRODUCT - WITH PAGINATION
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/1/reviews?skip=0&limit=10

###
### SIMULATE DELIVERY: Admin updates order to delivered status first
### (Prerequisite: Order must be created and admin must update it to "delivered")
PUT {{baseUrl}}/orders/1/status?new_status=delivered
Authorization: Bearer <paste-admin-token-here>
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

###
### CREATE REVIEW AFTER DELIVERY (Should succeed with 201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/products/1/reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "rating": 5,
  "comment": "Excellent product! Highly recommended!"
}

### @name createReview
# Save review ID for update/delete operations
@review_id = 1

###
### GET REVIEWS FOR PRODUCT (Including newly created review)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/1/reviews

###
### GET REVIEWS - Check Average Rating
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/1/reviews?skip=0&limit=5

###
### UPDATE OWN REVIEW
PUT {{baseUrl}}/reviews/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "rating": 4,
  "comment": "Good product, but could be better"
}

###
### GET UPDATED REVIEW
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/1/reviews

###
### ATTEMPT DUPLICATE REVIEW (Should fail with 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/products/1/reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "rating": 3,
  "comment": "Another review attempt"
}

###
### DELETE OWN REVIEW
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/reviews/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
### VERIFY REVIEW DELETED
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/1/reviews

###
### ERROR TEST: REVIEW WITHOUT TOKEN
POST {{baseUrl}}/products/1/reviews
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "rating": 5,
  "comment": "Unauthorized review"
}

###
### ERROR TEST: INVALID RATING (0)
POST {{baseUrl}}/products/1/reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "rating": 0,
  "comment": "Invalid rating"
}

###
### ERROR TEST: INVALID RATING (6)
POST {{baseUrl}}/products/1/reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "rating": 6,
  "comment": "Invalid rating"
}

###
### ERROR TEST: REVIEW NON-EXISTENT PRODUCT
POST {{baseUrl}}/products/99999/reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "rating": 5,
  "comment": "Review"
}

###
### ERROR TEST: UPDATE SOMEONE ELSE'S REVIEW (403 Forbidden)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/reviews/999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "rating": 2,
  "comment": "Hacked review"
}

###
### ERROR TEST: DELETE SOMEONE ELSE'S REVIEW (403 Forbidden)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/reviews/999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}